    {
      "id": "6Suk-7nOabGVyWYr0Rlym",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 99,
      "width": 774.0594482421875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 354170590,
      "version": 666,
      "versionNonce": 167421506,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786551118864,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    First approach\n    - Users hit the server to create a shortener version for your URL\n    - Server receive the URL, create a shortener version and save into dabase\n    - User hit the server with the short url, server will get the true url form db\nand will redirect the user to the original URL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    First approach\n    - Users hit the server to create a shortener version for your URL\n    - Server receive the URL, create a shortener version and save into dabase\n    - User hit the server with the short url, server will get the true url form db\nand will redirect the user to the original URL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zUanEsqsj1W_jtyM8Is6Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3,
      "y": -115,
      "width": 261.6598205566406,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 645694366,
      "version": 499,
      "versionNonce": 460612418,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786551128410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Api Design \n\n- GET /url/{short_prefix}\n    30X redirect to url\n \n- POST /url \n    body:\n    {\n        original_url: string\n    }\n    201 response:\n    {\n        short_url: string\n        ttl: number\n    }",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Api Design \n\n- GET /url/{short_prefix}\n    30X redirect to url\n \n- POST /url \n    body:\n    {\n        original_url: string\n    }\n    201 response:\n    {\n        short_url: string\n        ttl: number\n    }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8PHQkztwPZuyRPBt9HN0I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 455.85714285714266,
      "y": 259,
      "width": 731.1194458007812,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 378181662,
      "version": 430,
      "versionNonce": 1466333854,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786553307469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problemns \n- How to know the generated hash for the original url is unique? (hit db to\n check and hit db to create) \n- Single server will not redirect almos 2000 requests/sec (peak)\n- Single DB will not support 390 reads/seconds (peaks x5) + 32 w/s ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problemns \n- How to know the generated hash for the original url is unique? (hit db to\n check and hit db to create) \n- Single server will not redirect almos 2000 requests/sec (peak)\n- Single DB will not support 390 reads/seconds (peaks x5) + 32 w/s ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
