      "version": 735,
      "versionNonce": 294854558,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786553230749,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cosntraints\n\n- 100M URL/month \n- 10:1 read/write\n- Redirects < 100ms p99\n- Create < 500ms p99\n- 7 characters \n- 500 bytes/registry\n- 5 Years\n- Distributed\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20.2289447819736,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cosntraints\n\n- 100M URL/month \n- 10:1 read/write\n- Redirects < 100ms p99\n- Create < 500ms p99\n- 7 characters \n- 500 bytes/registry\n- 5 Years\n- Distributed\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SZe0gHHtYmHh1jlEaTSBI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -349.57142857142844,
      "y": 277,
      "width": 835.2196655273438,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 284361154,
      "version": 578,
      "versionNonce": 2027222430,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786552986205,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Write Throughput\n100.000.000 new URLs/month \n- 39 w/s \n\n2. Read Throughput\n- 10 * 39 = 390 r/s\n\n3. Total Storage \n100000000 * 12 * 5 = 6000000000 total registries\n6000000000 * 500 = 6 * 10^9  * 5 * 10^2 = 3 * 10^12\n3 * 10^12 = 3TB => 4TB couting with peaks \n\n4. Hash base 62 (A-Z) (a-z) (0-9)\n Url = 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 = 62^7 = 3.5Tri > 5 years total registries ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Write Throughput\n100.000.000 new URLs/month \n- 39 w/s \n\n2. Read Throughput\n- 10 * 39 = 390 r/s\n\n3. Total Storage \n100000000 * 12 * 5 = 6000000000 total registries\n6000000000 * 500 = 6 * 10^9  * 5 * 10^2 = 3 * 10^12\n3 * 10^12 = 3TB => 4TB couting with peaks \n\n4. Hash base 62 (A-Z) (a-z) (0-9)\n Url = 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 * 62 = 62^7 = 3.5Tri > 5 years total registries ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
