      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1470476190,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 469194718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786554775566,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Third approach\n - Sharded database + hash (id) %len(shard) . Now our app can write in multiples shard of the dabase\n - Snowflak id  \n - Still have high reads \n - we dont need to hit the database to check if id exists (snowflake)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Third approach\n - Sharded database + hash (id) %len(shard) . Now our app can write in multiples shard of the dabase\n - Snowflak id  \n - Still have high reads \n - we dont need to hit the database to check if id exists (snowflake)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
